$DATUM When a vial containing Fe(bMepi)Br (2.5 mol %) in neat 1-octene (1.0
mmol) was charged with 2.0 mmol of pinacolborane (HBPin), NaHBEt3 (7.5
mol %) and stirred at 23 °C for 20 h. The anti-Markovnikov hydroboration
product (2) was isolated in 90% yield.
