$DATUM 1-Chloro-1,2-dimethyl-1,2,2-tris[2'-(9"-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonyl)-ethyl]disilane
(3a): 29.6 mL (14.8 mmol) of 9-BBN (0.5 M solution in thf) was added to 1
g (4.93 mmol) of 3. 9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was added
slowly to a stirred solution of the disilane at room temperature. After 4
h the volatile components of the solution were removed under vacuum.
Yield: 2.6 g, 92.7%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= 26.3, -9.1 ppm. 11B-NMR: δB= 80.4
ppm. 13C-NMR: δC(ppm) = 1.1, -6.4 (Si-CH3), 5.2 (alkyl-bridge).
