$DATUM 1,2-Dichloro-1,2-dimethyl-1,2-bis[2'-(9"-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonyl)-ethyl]disilane
(2a): 19.0 mL (9.5 mmol) of 9-BBN (0.5 M solution in thf) was added to 1
g (4.74 mmol) of 2. 9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was added
slowly to a stirred solution of the disilane at room temperature. After 4
h the volatile components of the solution were removed under vacuum.
Yield: 2.0 g, 92.8%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= 20.0/20.2 ppm. 11B-NMR: δB= 85.6 ppm.
13C-NMR: δC(ppm) = -0.1 (Si-CH3), 10.8 (alkyl-bridge). GCMS: 234
(SiMeCl(CH2 CH2-9-BBN)), 193 (SiMe(CH2CH2-9-BBN)), 177
(Si-CH2-CH2-9-BBN), 155 (Si2Me2Cl2), 122 (9-BBN), 111 (C8H15), 82
(SiMe(CH2CH2B), 67 (Si(CH2CH2B)).
