$DATUM 1,1,2-Trichloro-1,2-dimethyl-2-[2'-(9"-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonyl)-propyl]
disilane (8a): 8.6 mL (4.3 mmol) of 9-BBN (0.5 M solution in thf) was
added to 1 g (4.28 mmol) of 8. 9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was
added slowly to a stirred solution of the disilane at room temperature.
After 4 h the volatile components of the solution were removed under
vacuum. Yield: 1.4 g, 92.0%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= 24.8, 15.2 ppm. 11B NMR: δB=
85.9 ppm. 13C-NMR: δC(ppm) = -0.6, 6.3 (Si-CH3), 18.2, 20.4
(alkyl-bridge). GCMS: 356 (M+), 241 (SiMe(CH2CH2CH2-9-BBN), 122 (9-BBN),
111 (C8H15), 82 (SiMe(CH2CH2B).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
