B2), -39.3 (d, 1, B4). 1H{11B} NMR (400.1 MHz, CDCl3, ppm): δ 4.07 (t, 2,
-OCH2-), 2.05 (s, 3, CH3), 1.65 (m, 2, CH2), 1.55 (m, 2, CH2), 1.39 (m,
6, CH2), -1.68 (br, s, 2, BHB), -2.02 (br, s, 2, BHB). (NaCl plates,
cm-1): 3236(b, w), 2930(vs), 2858(s), 2573(vs), 1907(b, w), 1717(vs),
1505(s), 1482(m), 1423(s), 1365(m), 1344(m), 1257(s), 1098(m), 1047(m),
