$DATUM 1,2-Dichloro-1,2-dimethyl-1,2-bis[2'-(9"-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonyl)-propyl]disilane
(9a): The reaction of 17.8 mL (8.9 mmol of 9-BBN (0.5 M solution in thf)
with 1 g (4.44 mmol) of 9. 9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was
added slowly to a stirred solution of the disilane at room temperature.
After 4 h the volatile components of the solution were removed under
vacuum. Yield: 1.9 g, 91.2%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= 17.9/18.1 ppm. 11B-NMR: δB=
85.8 ppm. 13C-NMR: δC(ppm) = -0.1 (Si-CH3), 18.3, 21.3 (alkyl-bridge).
