$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1,1,2,2-Tetraphenyl-1,2-bis[2'-(9"-borabicyclo-[3.3.1]nonyl)-ethyl]disilane
(10a): 10.7 mL (5.35 mmol) of 9-BBN (0.5 M solution in thf) was added to
1 g (2.67 mmol) 1,1,2,2-tetraphenyl-1,2- divinyldisilane.
9-borabicyclo[3.3.1]nonane or BH3*thf was added slowly to a stirred
solution of the disilane at room temperature. After 4 h the volatile
components of the solution were removed under vacuum. Yield: 1.5 g,
90.6%. 29Si-NMR: δSi= -18.0/-18.1 ppm. 11B-NMR: δB= 81.2 ppm. 13C-NMR:
δC(ppm) = 6.0 (alkyl-bridge), 127.6-136.0 (phenyl).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis of various boron-containing disilanes
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
