$DATUM Compound 7. One equivalent of bis(pentafluorophenyl)borane (58 mg in 1 mL
of toluene, 0.17 mmol) was added to a toluene suspension of 6 (100 mg,
0.17 mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred for 4 h, and then the
volatiles were removed under vacuum and the residue washed with pentane.
A 137 mg amount of a light yellow solid corresponding to compound 7 was
collected in 87% yield. Compound 7. yield 87% 1H NMR (500 MHz, C6D6, 298
K): δ / ppm = 7.29 (br, 2H, o-Ph), 7.16 (m, 2H, m-Ph), 7.13 (dd, 3J = 7.7
